.Sh STANDARDS
Generated documentation patches follow FreeBSD
.Xr mdoc 7
format conventions.
The configuration file uses YAML 1.2 syntax.
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
was created to address the documentation gap in FreeBSD development by
automatically identifying source code changes that require corresponding
documentation updates.
