.Sh BUGS
Known limitations:
.Bl -bullet
.It
Stage\~2 generation produces draft patches that require human review before
being applied or submitted upstream.
.It
LLM classification accuracy depends on the quality and size of the locally
available model.
.It
Only the FreeBSD
.Pa src
repository is directly supported as a commit source.
.El
.Pp
Report bugs at:
.Lk https://github.com/ebrandi/docgap/issues
